# Non-secret production switches for scripts/staging_rollout.py --target production.
# One KEY=value per line; blank lines and # comments are ignored.
# The six keys below are all required. The only other keys accepted are the optional CSA_PROD_*
# tuning keys and the optional Jev switches (CSA_STAGING_JEV_SECRET,
# CSA_STAGING_ASSISTANT_DECIDER_*, CSA_STAGING_CUSTOMER_DECIDE_MODE_DEFAULT,
# CSA_STAGING_JEV_FLOOR_*); only the shadow lines at the end of this file are set today. Adding or
# changing any key is a reviewed PR.
# GATEWAY_MODEL_SECRET names a secret; it never holds a secret value.
# The console and hooks origins and the backup bucket and region are not here (this repository
# is public): they live in /srv/csa-prod/host.env on the instance, with any CSA_PROD_* sizing
# override and CSA_PROD_DB_IMAGE.
# Every switch is on. The workspace assistant needs the gateway's model key, which is the same
# secret file the worker already reads (staging_model_key in the production secret directory):
# it must hold a real key before this deploy. Bookings Calendar and Meet need the Bookings
# calendar callback added as a redirect URI in the Google Cloud OAuth client; Meet needs Calendar.
CSA_STAGING_WORKSPACE_ASSISTANT=true
CSA_STAGING_GATEWAY_MODEL_SECRET=staging_model_key
CSA_STAGING_INVITE_MAIL=true
CSA_STAGING_EMAIL_ASSISTANT=true
CSA_STAGING_BOOKINGS_GOOGLE_CALENDAR=true
CSA_STAGING_BOOKINGS_GOOGLE_MEET=true
# Training video (gateway and training worker). On needs the training worker's own S3 key
# (storage/s3_training_access_key_id and storage/s3_training_secret_access_key in the production
# secret directory, deploy/PRODUCTION.md "Training video", owner steps 1 to 6) or plan stops
# with the files listed as missing before anything changes.
CSA_STAGING_TRAINING_VIDEO=true
CSA_PROD_S3_TRAINING_KEY=prod_s3_training
# Jev in shadow mode (docs/RUNBOOK.md, 'Jev for the staff assistant and the customer classifier';
# deploy/PRODUCTION.md, 'Jev on production (shadow)'). Shadow: Groq still decides every staff
# assistant question (email, routing, inbound injection); Jev runs beside it and only its answers are
# logged to decision_log. The real key file pipeline/staging_jev_key must exist in the production
# secret directory before the deploy, or plan stops with the file listed as missing. The customer
# classifier stays on the LLM (CSA_STAGING_CUSTOMER_DECIDE_MODE_DEFAULT is not set). Kill switch: set
# the three areas to llm, or remove these four lines. Evidence: the evaluation of 2026-11-17 and
# cascade running on staging since 2026-11-17. Moving to cascade is a reviewed PR (auto or cascade).
CSA_STAGING_JEV_SECRET=staging_jev_key
CSA_STAGING_ASSISTANT_DECIDER_EMAIL=shadow
CSA_STAGING_ASSISTANT_DECIDER_ROUTING=shadow
CSA_STAGING_ASSISTANT_DECIDER_INBOUND_INJECTION=shadow
